{"text": "Mister Utterson was sitting by his fireside one evening after dinner when he was surprised to receive a visit from Poole, Doctor Jekylls butler. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The butler, who was usually calm and proper, now looked so pale and nervous that Utterson asked him whether the doctor was ill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have been afraid for about a week, Poole said, and I can bear it no more, for I think there has been foul play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Poole would not explain any further, but he begged the lawyer to come with him at once and see the matter for himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Utterson rose without another word, and the two men went out together into the wild, cold March night under a pale moon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The wind made talking difficult, and it seemed to have swept the streets unusually bare of people that night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Never had Utterson felt so sharp a wish to see and touch his fellow human beings, for a heavy fear was pressing on his mind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When they reached the square, Poole stopped and wiped his brow with a red handkerchief, but it was fear, not the hurry, that had made him sweat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Well, sir, here we are, he said, and God grant that there be nothing wrong.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "U", "t", "t", "e", "r", "s", "o", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "y", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", "s", "i", "d", "e", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "d", "i", "n", "n", "e", "r", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "u", "r", "p", "r", "i", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "r", "e", "c", "e", "i", "v", "e", " ", "a", " ", "v", "i", "s", "i", "t", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "P", "o", "o", "l", "e", ",", " ", "D", "o", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "J", "e", "k", "y", "l", "l", "s", " ",